  function startKartRaceV704(mode='solo'){if(mode==='online'&&!(typeof multiplayerV2SportOnline==='function'&&multiplayerV2SportOnline('kart'))){toast('Entre na sessão online antes de iniciar a corrida.','warn',2200);return;}const k=SPORTS_V705.kart;if(!k||k.active)return;let kart=currentVehicleRef?.();if(!kart||kart.kind!=='kart'){kart=k.karts.find(v=>!v.occupied)||k.karts[0];enterVehicle(kart);}if(!player.vehicle||currentVehicleRef?.()?.kind!=='kart'){toast('Entre em um kart para correr.','warn');return;}const v=currentVehicleRef(),onlineIndex=mode==='online'&&typeof multiplayerV2SportParticipantIndex==='function'?multiplayerV2SportParticipantIndex('kart'):0,g=k.grid[Math.min(k.grid.length-1,onlineIndex)]||k.grid[0];v.group.position.set(g.x,0,g.z);v.group.rotation.y=g.heading;player.x=g.x;player.z=g.z;player.car.heading=g.heading;player.car.speed=0;k.active=true;k.mode=mode;configureSportControlsV705('kart');k.countdown=3.4;k.lap=0;k.expected=1;k.startAt=performance.now();k.lapStartAt=k.startAt;k.best=0;k.ai=[];for(let i=0;i<3;i++){const gr=new THREE.Group(),gg=k.grid[i+1];gr.position.set(gg.x,0,gg.z);worldGroup.add(gr);box(1.48,.2,2.02,[0x7d58c9,0xf28a22,0x138d83][i],0,.3,0,gr);box(.68,.32,.62,0x26384e,0,.56,-.25,gr);const helmet=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.SphereGeometry(.24,10,8),renderMat([0xf5d04b,0x5bc2ef,0xf5f6f7][i],{roughness:.5}));helmet.position.set(0,.93,-.28);gr.add(helmet);for(const [x,z]of[[-.76,-.65],[.76,-.65],[-.76,.65],[.76,.65]]){const w=cylinder(.28,.23,0x111827,x,.25,z,gr,12);w.rotation.z=Math.PI/2;}k.ai.push({group:gr,t:Math.max(.96,.994-i*.008),baseSpeed:.078+i*.0025,lap:-1,finished:false,lane:(i-1)*.38,skill:.92+i*.035});}SPORTS_V705.active=k;v705Hud('🏁 Kart OTTHI','3');toast('3 voltas. Hairpins, chicanes e faixas azuis de turbo: acelere e escolha a linha certa.','good',3200);}
  function updateKartRaceV704(dt){const k=SPORTS_V705.kart;if(!k?.active)return;const onlineV2=k.mode==='online'&&typeof multiplayerV2SportOnline==='function'&&multiplayerV2SportOnline('kart'),guestV2=onlineV2&&typeof multiplayerV2SportIsHost==='function'&&!multiplayerV2SportIsHost('kart');if(guestV2)v705ApplySportReplica('kart',dt);k.countdown-=dt;if(k.countdown>0){player.car.speed=0;v705Hud('🏁 Kart OTTHI',String(Math.ceil(k.countdown)));if(onlineV2&&!guestV2)v705PublishSport({type:'kart'});return;}const now=performance.now();if(!guestV2)for(const ai of k.ai){if(ai.finished)continue;const curvePenalty=clamp(v705KartCurvature(k,ai.t)*2.6,0,.42),nearPlayer=Math.hypot(player.x-ai.group.position.x,player.z-ai.group.position.z)<3.2?1.035:1;ai.t+=ai.baseSpeed*ai.skill*(1-curvePenalty)*nearPlayer*dt;if(ai.t>=1){ai.t-=1;ai.lap++;if(ai.lap>=3)ai.finished=true;}const p=k.curve.getPointAt(ai.t),tan=k.curve.getTangentAt(ai.t),nx=-tan.z,nz=tan.x;ai.group.position.set(p.x+nx*ai.lane,0,p.z+nz*ai.lane);ai.group.rotation.y=Math.atan2(tan.x,tan.z);const contact=Math.hypot(player.x-ai.group.position.x,player.z-ai.group.position.z);if(contact<1.55){const dx=player.x-ai.group.position.x,dz=player.z-ai.group.position.z,n=Math.max(.01,Math.hypot(dx,dz));player.x=ai.group.position.x+dx/n*1.62;player.z=ai.group.position.z+dz/n*1.62;player.car.speed*=.72;ai.t=(ai.t+.0025)%1;if(now>Number(k.lastContactAt||0)){k.lastContactAt=now+650;vibrate(28);beep(145,55,'square');}}}
    const cp=k.checkpoints[k.expected],d=cp?Math.hypot(player.x-cp.x,player.z-cp.z):Infinity;if(d<3.0){if(k.expected===0){k.lap++;const lapTime=(now-k.lapStartAt)/1000;k.lapStartAt=now;if(k.lap>1||lapTime>3)k.best=!k.best?lapTime:Math.min(k.best,lapTime);k.expected=1;toast(`Volta ${k.lap}/3 • ${lapTime.toFixed(1)}s`,'good',1100);if(k.lap>=3){k.active=false;const elapsed=(now-k.startAt)/1000,playerProgress=k.lap,aiBest=Math.max(...k.ai.map(a=>a.lap+(a.t||0))),won=playerProgress>=aiBest;addXP(won?65:30);if(won)addCoins(42);v705Hud('🏁 Kart OTTHI',`${elapsed.toFixed(1)}s • ${won?'1º lugar':'Chegada'} • melhor ${k.best.toFixed(1)}s`);toast(won?'Você venceu a corrida de kart!':'Corrida concluída.','good',2400);setTimeout(()=>{SPORTS_V705.active=null;clearSportControlsV705();v705HudOff();v705RestoreSpecial();},1700);return;}}else{k.expected++;if(k.expected>=k.checkpoints.length)k.expected=0;}}
    const track=v705TrackDistance(k,player.x,player.z);if(track.distance>3.6){player.car.speed=clamp(player.car.speed,-3,6.5);if(now>k.offTrackWarnAt){k.offTrackWarnAt=now+1500;toast('Fora da pista — volte ao asfalto.','warn',1000);}}for(const boost of k.boosts){if(Math.hypot(player.x-boost.x,player.z-boost.z)<2.2&&now-boost.lastAt>2200){boost.lastAt=now;player.car.kartBoostUntil=now+1000;player.car.speed=Math.max(Number(player.car.speed||0),23.5);beep(980,90,'square');vibrate(25);if(now>k.boostMessageAt){k.boostMessageAt=now+1600;toast('TURBO!','good',700);}}}
    const exactProgress=k.lap+track.t,kRanks=k.ai.map((a,i)=>({name:`CPU ${i+1}`,progress:a.lap+a.t}));if(onlineV2)for(const item of v705KartSharedPlayers())kRanks.push({name:`Jogador ${String(item.uid).slice(-4).toUpperCase()}`,progress:Number(item.lap||0)+Number(item.progress||0)});kRanks.push({name:'Você',progress:exactProgress});kRanks.sort((a,b)=>b.progress-a.progress);const pos=kRanks.findIndex(r=>r.name==='Você')+1,boosting=now<Number(player.car.kartBoostUntil||0);v705Hud('🏁 Kart OTTHI',`Volta ${Math.min(3,k.lap+1)}/3 • ${pos}º/${kRanks.length} • ${boosting?'TURBO • ':''}CP ${k.expected}/${k.checkpoints.length-1}`);v705PublishSport({type:'kart',lap:k.lap,checkpoint:k.expected,position:pos,progress:+track.t.toFixed(3)});}
  function handleActiveSportActionV704(){if(SPORTS_V705.football){footballKickV704();return true;}const a=SPORTS_V705.active;if(a?.type==='volley'){if(!courtHitV704())toast('Entre na sombra da bola para sacar, receber ou atacar.','warn',750);return true;}if(a?.type==='footvolley'){v705CourtTouch('touch');return true;}if(a?.type==='kart')return leaveCurrentSportV705();return false;}
  function handleActiveSportSpecialV704(){if(SPORTS_V705.football){v705FootballPass();return true;}const a=SPORTS_V705.active;if(a&&['volley','footvolley'].includes(a.type)){if(!v705CourtSet())toast('Entre na sombra da bola para levantar.','warn',750);return true;}return false;}
  function handleActiveSportRunControlV705(active){const type=activeSportControlTypeV705();if(!type||type==='kart')return false;if(type==='football'){input.touchSprint=!!active;syncSportControlsV705();return true;}if(!active)return true;if(type==='volley')v705CourtTouch('block');else if(type==='footvolley')v705CourtTouch('header');syncSportControlsV705();return true;}
  function handleActiveSportJumpControlV705(active=true){const type=activeSportControlTypeV705();if(!type||type==='kart')return false;if(!active)return true;if(type==='football')v705FootballTackle();else if(type==='volley')v705CourtTouch('spike');else if(type==='footvolley')v705CourtTouch('kick');syncSportControlsV705();return true;}
  function v705SportRemoteParticipants(type){const match=typeof multiplayerV2SportMatch==='function'?multiplayerV2SportMatch(type):null,own=typeof multiplayerV2OwnUid==='function'?multiplayerV2OwnUid():String(window.OTTHOS_RTDB?.uid||'');const out=[];for(const uid of Object.keys(match?.participants||{})){if(uid===own)continue;const target=remotePresence.get(String(uid)),pose=typeof multiplayerV2RemotePose==='function'?multiplayerV2RemotePose(uid,target||{},false):target;if(pose)out.push({uid,pose,target});}return out;}
  function v705RemoteFootballCarry(f,dt){if(!f||f.possession===0||f.cooldown>0)return false;let best=null,bestD=Infinity;for(const entry of v705SportRemoteParticipants('football')){const d=Math.hypot(f.ball.position.x-Number(entry.pose.x||0),f.ball.position.z-Number(entry.pose.z||0));if(d<bestD){bestD=d;best=entry;}}if(!best||bestD>1.3)return false;const pose=best.pose,heading=Number(pose.r||0),tx=Number(pose.x||0)+Math.sin(heading)*.9,tz=Number(pose.z||0)+Math.cos(heading)*.9;f.ball.position.x=lerp(f.ball.position.x,tx,Math.min(1,dt*11));f.ball.position.z=lerp(f.ball.position.z,tz,Math.min(1,dt*11));f.vx=Number(pose.vx||0)*.7;f.vz=Number(pose.vz||0)*.7;f.possession=best.uid;return true;}
  function v705KartSharedPlayers(){const own=typeof multiplayerV2OwnUid==='function'?multiplayerV2OwnUid():String(window.OTTHOS_RTDB?.uid||''),state=typeof multiplayerV2SportState==='function'?multiplayerV2SportState('kart'):null,match=typeof multiplayerV2SportMatch==='function'?multiplayerV2SportMatch('kart'):null,source=Array.isArray(state?.players)?state.players:Object.entries(match?.inputs||{}).map(([uid,input])=>({uid,lap:Number(input?.lap||0),progress:Number(input?.progress||0),checkpoint:Number(input?.checkpoint||0)}));return source.filter(item=>String(item?.uid||'')&&String(item.uid)!==own);}
  function v705SportActorSnapshot(a){return a?.group?[+a.group.position.x.toFixed(3),+a.group.position.y.toFixed(3),+a.group.position.z.toFixed(3),+a.group.rotation.y.toFixed(4)]:null;}
  function v705SportStateSnapshot(type){
    const now=Date.now();if(type==='football'){const f=SPORTS_V705.football;if(!f)return null;return{type,at:now,countdown:+Number(f.countdown||0).toFixed(3),time:+Number(f.time||0).toFixed(3),score:[Number(f.score?.[0]||0),Number(f.score?.[1]||0)],finished:!!f.finished,ball:[+f.ball.position.x.toFixed(3),+f.ball.position.y.toFixed(3),+f.ball.position.z.toFixed(3),+Number(f.vx||0).toFixed(3),0,+Number(f.vz||0).toFixed(3)],home:f.home.map(v705SportActorSnapshot),away:f.away.map(v705SportActorSnapshot)};}
    if(type==='volley'||type==='footvolley'){const c=SPORTS_V705.courts.get(type);if(!c?.ball)return null;return{type,at:now,timer:+Number(c.timer||0).toFixed(3),state:String(c.state||''),serving:Number(c.serving||0),score:[Number(c.score?.[0]||0),Number(c.score?.[1]||0)],touches:[Number(c.touches?.[0]||0),Number(c.touches?.[1]||0)],lastSide:Number(c.lastSide??-1),ball:[+c.ball.position.x.toFixed(3),+c.ball.position.y.toFixed(3),+c.ball.position.z.toFixed(3),+Number(c.vx||0).toFixed(3),+Number(c.vy||0).toFixed(3),+Number(c.vz||0).toFixed(3)],team:c.team.map(v705SportActorSnapshot),opponents:c.opponents.map(v705SportActorSnapshot)};}
    if(type==='kart'){const k=SPORTS_V705.kart;if(!k?.active)return null;const match=typeof multiplayerV2SportMatch==='function'?multiplayerV2SportMatch('kart'):null,players=Object.entries(match?.inputs||{}).map(([uid,input])=>({uid:String(uid),lap:Number(input?.lap||0),progress:+Number(input?.progress||0).toFixed(5),checkpoint:Number(input?.checkpoint||0)}));return{type,at:now,countdown:+Number(k.countdown||0).toFixed(3),lap:Number(k.lap||0),expected:Number(k.expected||0),active:!!k.active,players,ai:k.ai.map(ai=>({pose:v705SportActorSnapshot(ai),t:+Number(ai.t||0).toFixed(5),lap:Number(ai.lap||0),finished:!!ai.finished}))};}return null;
  }
  function v705ApplyActorReplica(actor,row,dt){if(!actor?.group||!Array.isArray(row))return;const k=Math.min(1,dt*13);actor.group.position.x=lerp(actor.group.position.x,Number(row[0]||0),k);actor.group.position.y=lerp(actor.group.position.y,Number(row[1]||0),k);actor.group.position.z=lerp(actor.group.position.z,Number(row[2]||0),k);actor.group.rotation.y=lerpAngle(actor.group.rotation.y,Number(row[3]||0),k);}
  function v705ApplySportReplica(type,dt){const state=typeof multiplayerV2SportState==='function'?multiplayerV2SportState(type):null;if(!state||state.type!==type)return false;const age=clamp((Date.now()-Number(state.at||Date.now()))/1000,0,.14),k=Math.min(1,dt*15);
    if(type==='football'){const f=SPORTS_V705.football;if(!f)return false;f.countdown=Number(state.countdown??f.countdown);f.time=Number(state.time??f.time);f.score=[Number(state.score?.[0]||0),Number(state.score?.[1]||0)];f.finished=!!state.finished;const b=state.ball;if(Array.isArray(b)){f.ball.position.x=lerp(f.ball.position.x,Number(b[0]||0)+Number(b[3]||0)*age,k);f.ball.position.y=lerp(f.ball.position.y,Number(b[1]||.52),k);f.ball.position.z=lerp(f.ball.position.z,Number(b[2]||0)+Number(b[5]||0)*age,k);f.vx=Number(b[3]||0);f.vz=Number(b[5]||0);}for(let i=0;i<f.home.length;i++)v705ApplyActorReplica(f.home[i],state.home?.[i],dt);for(let i=0;i<f.away.length;i++)v705ApplyActorReplica(f.away[i],state.away?.[i],dt);v705UpdateScoreboard(f.score[0],f.score[1]);v705Hud('⚽ Futebol OTTHI',f.countdown>0?String(Math.ceil(f.countdown)):`${Math.ceil(f.time)}s • ${f.score[0]} × ${f.score[1]} • ONLINE`);return true;}
    if(type==='volley'||type==='footvolley'){const c=SPORTS_V705.courts.get(type);if(!c?.ball)return false;c.timer=Number(state.timer??c.timer);c.state=String(state.state||c.state);c.serving=Number(state.serving??c.serving);c.score=[Number(state.score?.[0]||0),Number(state.score?.[1]||0)];c.touches=[Number(state.touches?.[0]||0),Number(state.touches?.[1]||0)];c.lastSide=Number(state.lastSide??c.lastSide);const b=state.ball;if(Array.isArray(b)){c.ball.position.x=lerp(c.ball.position.x,Number(b[0]||0)+Number(b[3]||0)*age,k);c.ball.position.y=lerp(c.ball.position.y,Number(b[1]||0)+Number(b[4]||0)*age,k);c.ball.position.z=lerp(c.ball.position.z,Number(b[2]||0)+Number(b[5]||0)*age,k);c.vx=Number(b[3]||0);c.vy=Number(b[4]||0);c.vz=Number(b[5]||0);}for(let i=0;i<c.team.length;i++)v705ApplyActorReplica(c.team[i],state.team?.[i],dt);for(let i=0;i<c.opponents.length;i++)v705ApplyActorReplica(c.opponents[i],state.opponents?.[i],dt);if(c.shadow){c.shadow.visible=true;c.shadow.position.set(c.ball.position.x,.24,c.ball.position.z);}v705Hud(`${c.foot?'🏖️':'🏐'} ${c.label}`,`${c.score[0]} × ${c.score[1]} • ONLINE`);return true;}
    if(type==='kart'){const krt=SPORTS_V705.kart;if(!krt?.active)return false;krt.countdown=Number(state.countdown??krt.countdown);for(let i=0;i<krt.ai.length;i++){const src=state.ai?.[i];if(!src)continue;v705ApplyActorReplica(krt.ai[i],src.pose,dt);krt.ai[i].t=Number(src.t??krt.ai[i].t);krt.ai[i].lap=Number(src.lap??krt.ai[i].lap);krt.ai[i].finished=!!src.finished;}return true;}return false;
  }
  function v705GuestSportAction(type,action,data={}){if(typeof multiplayerV2SportOnline!=='function'||!multiplayerV2SportOnline(type)||typeof multiplayerV2SportIsHost!=='function'||multiplayerV2SportIsHost(type))return false;return typeof multiplayerV2SendSportInput==='function'&&multiplayerV2SendSportInput(type,action,data);}
  function v705ApplyRemoteSportInputV2(type,uid,input){const target=remotePresence.get(String(uid||'')),pose=typeof multiplayerV2RemotePose==='function'?multiplayerV2RemotePose(uid,target||{},false):target;if(!pose||!input)return false;const heading=Number(input.r??pose.r??0),fx=Math.sin(heading),fz=Math.cos(heading);
    if(type==='football'){const f=SPORTS_V705.football;if(!f||Math.hypot(f.ball.position.x-Number(pose.x||0),f.ball.position.z-Number(pose.z||0))>3.25)return false;const action=String(input.action||'');let power=action==='pass'?7.8:action==='tackle'?6.4:11.4;if(!['kick','pass','tackle'].includes(action))return false;f.vx=fx*power+Number(input.vx||0)*.18;f.vz=fz*power+Number(input.vz||0)*.18;f.cooldown=.28;f.possession=-1;return true;}
    if(type==='volley'||type==='footvolley'){const c=SPORTS_V705.courts.get(type);if(!c?.ball||Math.hypot(c.ball.position.x-Number(pose.x||0),c.ball.position.z-Number(pose.z||0))>3.0)return false;const action=String(input.action||'');if(!['hit','serve','set','touch','header','kick','block','spike'].includes(action))return false;const attack=['spike','kick','hit','serve'].includes(action),set=action==='set',targetX=clamp(c.ball.position.x+fx*3,c.cx-c.w/2+1,c.cx+c.w/2-1);c.vx=clamp((targetX-c.ball.position.x)*.55,-4,4);c.vz=Math.abs(fz)*(attack?7.6:set?1.5:4.4);if(Number(pose.z||0)>c.cz)c.vz*=-1;c.vy=set?(c.foot?5.3:7.2):action==='block'?4.4:attack?(c.foot?5.5:6.5):4.8;c.state='play';c.lastSide=Number(pose.z||0)<c.cz?0:1;return true;}return false;
  }
