    const lift=workshopLiftRuntime(),id=String(vehicle?.id||'');if(!lift||!id)return{vehicleId:id,wheels:{},parts:{}};if(!lift.disassembly||String(lift.disassembly.vehicleId||'')!==id)lift.disassembly={vehicleId:id,wheels:{},parts:{}};lift.disassembly.wheels=lift.disassembly.wheels&&typeof lift.disassembly.wheels==='object'?lift.disassembly.wheels:{};lift.disassembly.parts=lift.disassembly.parts&&typeof lift.disassembly.parts==='object'?lift.disassembly.parts:{};return lift.disassembly;
